        "created_at": "2017-02-08T00:54:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>So am I correct in thinking we'd heard the name of Expatriette's father before? \"Citizen Pain\" sounded somehow familiar, yet I'd been expecting that to be the big reveal. All the stuff about Scholar was cool, I love that the final Word From On High about Biomancer is \"He's really gross\", and we heard a few Scion names! That's gotta count for something! :D</span></p>",
