        "created_at": "2017-02-08T03:54:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Citizen Pain,\" was a common (correct) guess for the tombstone seen on \"Return with the Dawn\" from Sentinel Tactics, who we had been told was Expat's father. So the name has been floating around for a while, but never confirmed until now.</p>",
