      {
        "id": 188778,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-02-09T03:41:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Amanda’s story would make a great TV series.  Start out with a teenager finding her way through the country, flashbacks and murders, it could be really well done.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I would watch the Expatriette version of “Arrow!” I think she would be much more interesting.</p>\n<p>I thought Christopher actually mentioned the Contract by name. It wasn’t the first time he talked about the sleazy white-suit guy, and it was kind of offhand, but there was something about how he said “when she took the contract on Slim.” Maybe he said “when the Contract talked to her about Slim” or some similar phrasing.</p>\n<p>Also, I totally want to see the movie where Slim and Amanda go all Equilibrium Gun Kata. Her first encounter with him sounds great.</p>",
